# The additional IP address(es) of hosts allowed to connect to the 
# backup MPP master instance. This adds an entry in the PostgreSQL 
# pg_hba.conf file on the backup master instance created. You must 
# at least supply the IP of the primary master host. The following 
# setting will allow connections from all hosts.


